  "description": "Bring timeless elegance and delicate craftsmanship to your design work with Adellisa, a true single-line script font. Formed with continuous fluid loops, graceful calligraphic curves, and ultra-clean monoline paths, Adellisa is specifically optimized for foil quill, engraving, CNC routing, and plotting machines. Excellent for wedding invitations, greeting cards, delicate logo design, and boutique branding.",
